REQUIRED
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token_here
ACCESS CONTROL
ALLOWED_TELEGRAM_USERS=12345678,98765432
DOMAIN WHITELISTING (Optional: comma-separated domains. Leave empty to allow all)
ALLOWED_DOMAINS=github.com,amazon.com,news.ycombinator.com
CONCURRENCY CONTROL & TIMEOUTS
MAX_CONCURRENT_TASKS=3
COMMAND_TIMEOUT=90
AES ENCRYPTION KEY FOR SESSIONS AT REST (Optional: Auto-generated if left blank)
SESSION_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
AI EXTRACTION
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here
CAPTCHA SOLVER (Optional)
CAPSOLVER_API_KEY=your_capsolver_key_here
PROXIES (Optional)
PROXY_SERVER=http://pr.oxylab.net:8000
PROXY_USERNAME=your_proxy_user
PROXY_PASSWORD=your_proxy_pass